# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，检出到工作区也保持 LF
# 目的：避免 Windows 端编辑工具（Python open / 编辑器）把 \n 写成 \r\n，
#      导致 diff 变成整文件重写（曾发生：3000+ 行全量替换）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.pdf binary
